                                                "sense_id": "8f01dd6a-46f9-3698-973e-f33dc4c8c4c7",
                                                "text": "They include an acroterion, or pediment decoration, of a winged sphinx; an Etruscan terra cotta antefix, or roof ornament, similar to one returned by the Getty last year; and terra cotta reliefs of warriors on horseback."
